  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.physics_basics": "物理常识",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.physics_basics.desc": "对力、运动、光热与自然现象的基础常识。",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.classical_mechanics": "经典力学",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.classical_mechanics.desc": "研究质点与刚体运动规律、牛顿定律及动量能量守恒。",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.acoustics": "声学",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.acoustics.desc": "研究机械波在水与岩层中的传播、反射与回声测距。",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.optics": "光学",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.optics.desc": "研究光线折射、反射与色散，磨制凹凸透镜并组装分光镜。",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.electromagnetism": "电磁学",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.electromagnetism.desc": "揭示电流磁效应与电磁感应定律，制造万用表与工业电磁铁。",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.quantum_mechanics": "量子力学",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.quantum_mechanics.desc": "解析原子能级跃迁与特征光谱，解锁分光镜元素质量分数读数。",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.vacuum_technology": "真空技术",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.vacuum_technology.desc": "制造机械与扩散真空泵及高真空冶金炉。",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.xray_physics": "X 射线物理",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.xray_physics.desc": "利用高真空钨靶管激发 X 射线，建造 X 射线衍射仪。",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.nuclear_physics": "核物理与放射性",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.nuclear_physics.desc": "探索原子核衰变、同位素分离与电离辐射定量测量。",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.condensed_matter": "凝聚态物理",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.condensed_matter.desc": "解析晶体能带结构与晶格衍射图谱，解锁衍射仪精确晶系读数。",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.cryogenics": "低温物理",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.cryogenics.desc": "通过空分与多级膨胀制冷液化氮、氧、氢、氦并用杜瓦瓶绝热保存。",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.superconductivity": "超导",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.superconductivity.desc": "合成钇钡铜氧超导带材并在液氮温区实现零电阻输电与强磁场线圈。",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.plasma_physics": "等离子体物理",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.plasma_physics.desc": "研究高温电离气体的磁流体力学行为与磁约束稳定性。",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.lasers": "激光",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.lasers.desc": "利用受激辐射光放大原理制造高功率工业激光切割与波导刻写设备。",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.particle_acceleration": "粒子加速",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.particle_acceleration.desc": "建造回旋加速器，利用交变电场与强磁场加速带电粒子束流。",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.high_energy_batteries": "高能电池",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.high_energy_batteries.desc": "研制镍钴铝锂离子高能电池芯，提供兆焦耳级高功率储能。",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.controlled_fusion": "受控聚变",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.controlled_fusion.desc": "以超导磁约束腔与聚变点火器实现氘氚/氘氘受控热核聚变发电。",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.relativity": "相对论",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.relativity.desc": "掌握狭义与广义相对论时空变换、质能方程及引力时间膨胀修正。",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.precision_metrology": "精密计量",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.precision_metrology.desc": "利用铷原子超精细能级跃迁制造全服同相位的原子钟时间基准。",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.physics_mastery": "物理精研",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.phy.physics_mastery.desc": "融汇声光电磁、量子超导、粒子加速与受控核聚变，使物理器件臻至传世品阶。",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.cmp.electronics_basics": "电子常识",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.cmp.electronics_basics.desc": "对电路通断、信号传输与电子元器件的基础常识。",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.cmp.circuit_theory": "电路原理",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.cmp.circuit_theory.desc": "掌握基尔霍夫定律、阻抗匹配与信号放大原理，解锁万用表精确读数。",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.cmp.vacuum_electronics": "电子管",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.cmp.vacuum_electronics.desc": "利用高真空热阴极发射制造二极管、三极管与五极管。",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.cmp.semiconductor_physics": "半导体物理",
  "lore.earth_physical_sciences.cmp.semiconductor_physics.desc": "研究本征与掺杂半导体的载流子输运与光电效应，制造光伏发电面板。",
